scenario: VOICE-MIC-01
title: USB microphone dictation
area: Voice
rows: F-VOICE-04, F-VOICE-18, F-HW-02
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: A USB microphone (or a headset) is plugged in. A quiet room.
step: Open Settings, Voice and look at the list of microphones.
expect: Your microphone is listed by name and chosen.
clause: F-VOICE-04.listed
step: Open the VOICE tile, DICTATE. Press Record and read this sentence at normal speed: The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.
expect: A red recording indicator shows for as long as you record, and recording never starts by itself.
clause: F-VOICE-18.indicator
step: Press Stop and wait a moment.
expect: The words appear as text within a few seconds and are close to what you said (one or two wrong words are acceptable).
clause: F-VOICE-04.text
step: Unplug the microphone while the VOICE tile is open and press Record.
expect: A plain sentence says that no microphone was found; nothing crashes and the indicator does not stay on.
clause: F-HW-02.unplug
